---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Vaibhav Chavan — Oracle HCM Cloud Technical Architect. A decade of APAC implementations across Taiwan, Singapore, Malaysia, the Philippines, Hong Kong and Thailand."
>
  <div class="ab">

    <!-- ══════════ INTRO BAND ══════════ -->
    <section class="ab-shell">
      <div class="band">
        <div class="band-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="ab-eyebrow">About</div>
            <h1>Vaibhav Chavan</h1>
            <div class="role">Oracle HCM Cloud Technical Architect</div>

            <p>
              Over the last decade I have architected and delivered complex Oracle HCM Cloud
              implementations across the US & APAC region, most recently multi-country rollouts.
            </p>
            <p>
              I work heavily on the <strong>techno-functional edge</strong> — close enough to the
              configuration to know what the business actually asked for, and close enough to the
              code to know why it won't do that yet.
            </p>

            <div class="apac">
              <div class="apac-label">Recent multi-country rollouts</div>
              <div class="apac-row">
                <span class="geo"><b>TW</b><span>Taiwan</span></span>
                <span class="geo"><b>SG</b><span>Singapore</span></span>
                <span class="geo"><b>MY</b><span>Malaysia</span></span>
                <span class="geo"><b>PH</b><span>Philippines</span></span>
                <span class="geo"><b>HK</b><span>Hong Kong</span></span>
                <span class="geo"><b>TH</b><span>Thailand</span></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="ace">
              <img
                src="/images/about/oracle-ace-associate.png"
                alt="Oracle ACE Associate"
                width="1120" height="277" loading="eager" decoding="async"
              />
              <span class="ace-tag">
                <span>AIOUG <span class="sep">·</span> Active member</span>
                <b>ACE Associate</b>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="stats">
              <div class="stat"><b>10+</b><span>YEARS ON HCM CLOUD</span></div>
              <div class="stat"><b>6</b><span>APAC MARKETS</span></div>
              <div class="stat"><b>10</b><span>MODULES COVERED</span></div>
              <div class="stat"><b>30+</b><span>FORMULAS DOCUMENTED</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════ THE MISSING MANUAL ══════════ -->
    <section class="ab-shell sec">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="sec-kicker">Why this site exists</div>
        <h2>The missing manual</h2>
        <p class="sec-lead">
          Oracle's official documentation is excellent at telling you <strong>what</strong> a
          feature does. It is entirely silent on the edges — and the edges are where
          implementations actually fail. Three examples I've hit in production:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gaps">
        <article class="gap">
          <div class="gap-tag">Absence Management</div>
          <code class="ident">IV_ACCRUAL</code>
          <p>
            How it <em>actually</em> behaves inside a matrix accrual — not what the parameter
            list implies it should do.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="gap">
          <div class="gap-tag">Release 26A · Logging</div>
          <code class="ident">ESS_LOG_WRITE</code>
          <p>
            Why it <em>blows up</em> in 26A when called inside a Global Absence Carryover
            formula, and what to use instead.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="gap">
          <div class="gap-tag">Core HR · Global Transfer</div>
          <code class="ident">PER_ASG_REL_ORIGINAL_DATE_OF_HIRE</code>
          <p>
            What <em>realistically</em> happens to it after a Global Transfer — as opposed to
            what the DBI description promises.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="sec-lead sec-lead--after">
        That gap is the whole reason this site is here. I document the exact behaviours, the
        traps, and the solutions I run into on live production rollouts — while they're still
        fresh enough to be accurate.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════ WHAT YOU'LL FIND ══════════ -->
    <section class="ab-shell sec">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="sec-kicker">Coverage</div>
        <h2>What you will find here</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="cover">
        <article class="cov">
          <span class="cov-ico" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6l-5 6 5 6M16 6l5 6-5 6"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Production-ready code</h3>
            <p>Fast Formulas with named-employee worked examples, traced line by line from input contract to RETURN.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cov">
          <span class="cov-ico" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 17l6-6-6-6"/><path d="M12 19h8"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Logging &amp; debugging</h3>
            <p>Practical debug logging idioms for every formula type — and the profile options that silently discard them.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cov">
          <span class="cov-ico" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a15 15 0 0 1 0 18a15 15 0 0 1 0-18z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>APAC architectural patterns</h3>
            <p>Multi-country leave policies, accrual matrices, and the TER/TCR frameworks that hold them together.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cov">
          <span class="cov-ico" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 6v12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V6"/><path d="M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3>Data &amp; UI notes</h3>
            <p>Advanced strategies for Redwood UI and HDL Transformation Formulas, including the mappings that aren't documented.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="mods">
        <span class="mod">Core HR</span>
        <span class="mod">Absence Management</span>
        <span class="mod">Time and Labor</span>
        <span class="mod">Compensation</span>
        <span class="mod">Benefits</span>
        <span class="mod">Payroll</span>
        <span class="mod">Recruiting</span>
        <span class="mod">Redwood</span>
        <span class="mod">HDL</span>
        <span class="mod">OTBI</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══════════ CONTACT + DISCLAIMER ══════════ -->
    <section class="ab-shell sec sec--last">
      <div class="contact">
        <div>
          <h3>Hit one of these edges yourself?</h3>
          <p>Corrections and counter-examples are genuinely welcome — they make the notes better.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a class="clink" href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
          <a class="clink clink--go" href="/">Read the articles</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="note">
        Notes on this site are personal and reflect the author's views, not those of any employer
        or client. Oracle and the Oracle product names referenced are trademarks of Oracle
        Corporation.
      </p>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Everything is scoped under .ab so nothing leaks into the shared layout. */
  .ab{
    --ab-bg:        #FDF6EE;
    --ab-surface:   #FFFFFF;
    --ab-surface-2: #F7EFE4;
    --ab-line:      #E6DACA;
    --ab-line-soft: #EFE6D9;

    --ab-navy:      #003060;
    --ab-ink:       #0A2A4A;
    --ab-dim:       #56687E;
    --ab-faint:     #8A98A8;

    --ab-blue:      #184878;
    --ab-blue-lift: #186090;
    --ab-orange:    #F07818;
    --ab-orange-dp: #C05A10;
    --ab-orange-wash: rgba(240,120,24,.09);
    --ab-orange-edge: rgba(240,120,24,.42);

    --ab-f: Verdana, Geneva, 'DejaVu Sans', sans-serif;

    background: var(--ab-bg);
    color: var(--ab-ink);
    font-family: var(--ab-f);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.72;
    padding-block: 26px 8px;
  }
  .ab *{box-sizing:border-box}
  .ab-shell{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}

  /* ── intro band ── */
  .band{
    position:relative;margin:0 0 40px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(70% 120% at 92% 14%, rgba(24,72,120,.05), transparent 58%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,#FFFCF8 0%, var(--ab-surface-2) 100%);
    border:1px solid var(--ab-line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .band::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:3px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ab-navy) 0%, var(--ab-blue-lift) 46%, var(--ab-orange) 100%);
  }
  .band-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1fr);
    gap:36px;align-items:start;padding:36px 34px 32px;
  }
  .ab-eyebrow{
    background:none;padding:0;border-radius:0;      /* beat global .eyebrow pill */
    font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ab-orange-dp);margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  }
  .ab-eyebrow::after{
    content:'';height:2px;flex:1;max-width:120px;border-radius:2px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ab-orange),transparent);
  }
  .ab h1{
    font-family:var(--ab-f);font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(1.85rem,3.4vw,2.65rem);
    line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.038em;color:var(--ab-navy);margin:0 0 6px;
  }
  .role{
    font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ab-orange-dp);
    letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .band p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ab-dim);margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch}
  .band p strong{color:var(--ab-navy);font-weight:700}

  .apac{margin-top:22px}
  .apac-label{
    font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ab-faint);margin-bottom:9px;
  }
  .apac-row{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .geo{
    display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;
    min-width:58px;padding:7px 9px;background:var(--ab-surface);
    border:1px solid var(--ab-line);border-radius:8px;
    transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease;
  }
  .geo:hover{border-color:var(--ab-orange-edge);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .geo b{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ab-navy);letter-spacing:.02em}
  .geo span{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ab-faint);letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}

  .ace{
    display:block;border:1px solid var(--ab-line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--ab-surface);
    box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(10,42,74,.04), 0 12px 30px -18px rgba(10,42,74,.26);
  }
  .ace img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
  .ace-tag{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;
    padding:10px 15px;background:var(--ab-surface-2);border-top:1px solid var(--ab-line-soft);
    font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ab-faint);
  }
  .ace-tag b{color:var(--ab-navy);font-weight:700}
  .ace-tag .sep{color:var(--ab-orange)}

  .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:9px;margin-top:12px}
  .stat{background:var(--ab-surface);border:1px solid var(--ab-line);border-radius:9px;padding:11px 12px}
  .stat b{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ab-navy);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .stat span{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ab-faint);letter-spacing:.03em}

  /* ── sections ── */
  .sec{padding-bottom:46px}
  .sec--last{padding-bottom:20px}
  .sec-head{margin-bottom:20px}
  .sec-kicker{
    font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ab-orange-dp);margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .ab h2{
    font-family:var(--ab-f);font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(1.35rem,2.4vw,1.8rem);
    letter-spacing:-.032em;color:var(--ab-navy);line-height:1.2;margin:0;
  }
  .sec-lead{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ab-dim);max-width:64ch;margin:12px 0 0}
  .sec-lead--after{margin-top:22px}
  .sec-lead strong{color:var(--ab-navy);font-weight:700}

  /* ── missing manual ── */
  .gaps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:24px}
  .gap{
    position:relative;background:var(--ab-surface);border:1px solid var(--ab-line);
    border-radius:12px;padding:20px;overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(10,42,74,.03);
    transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;
  }
  .gap:hover{
    border-color:var(--ab-orange-edge);transform:translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(10,42,74,.04), 0 16px 34px -20px rgba(10,42,74,.26);
  }
  .gap::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:3px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ab-navy),var(--ab-orange));
    opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s ease;
  }
  .gap:hover::after{opacity:1}
  .gap-tag{
    font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ab-faint);margin-bottom:11px;
  }
  .ab .ident{
    display:block;background:#F4F8FC;border:1px solid #D8E4F0;
    border-left:3px solid var(--ab-blue);border-radius:6px;
    padding:9px 11px;margin-bottom:13px;
    font-family:var(--ab-f);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.035em;
    color:var(--ab-navy);word-break:break-all;line-height:1.45;
  }
  .gap p{font-size:13px;color:var(--ab-dim);line-height:1.65;margin:0}
  .gap p em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ab-orange-dp);font-weight:700}

  /* ── coverage ── */
  .cover{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:22px}
  .cov{
    display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;
    background:var(--ab-surface);border:1px solid var(--ab-line);
    border-radius:12px;padding:19px 20px;
    transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease;
  }
  .cov:hover{border-color:var(--ab-orange-edge);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .cov-ico{
    width:36px;height:36px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:9px;
    background:var(--ab-surface-2);border:1px solid var(--ab-line);
    display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--ab-navy);
  }
  .cov-ico svg{width:17px;height:17px}
  .ab .cov h3{
    font-family:var(--ab-f);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ab-navy);
    letter-spacing:-.024em;margin:0 0 5px;line-height:1.35;
  }
  .cov p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ab-dim);line-height:1.6;margin:0}

  .mods{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:20px}
  .mod{
    font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;
    color:var(--ab-dim);background:var(--ab-surface);
    border:1px solid var(--ab-line);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;
    transition:color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;
  }
  .mod:hover{color:var(--ab-orange-dp);border-color:var(--ab-orange-edge)}

  /* ── contact ── */
  .contact{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    background:var(--ab-navy);border-radius:14px;padding:24px 28px;margin-bottom:30px;
  }
  .ab .contact h3{
    font-family:var(--ab-f);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;
    letter-spacing:-.026em;margin:0 0 4px;
  }
  .contact p{font-size:13px;color:#A8C0D8;margin:0}
  .contact-links{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .ab .clink{
    font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;
    padding:9px 16px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24);color:#fff;
    transition:background .18s ease,border-color .18s ease;
  }
  .ab .clink:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4)}
  .ab .clink--go{background:var(--ab-orange);border-color:var(--ab-orange)}
  .ab .clink--go:hover{background:#FF8A2B;border-color:#FF8A2B}

  .note{
    border-top:1px solid var(--ab-line);padding-top:18px;margin:0;
    font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ab-faint);line-height:1.7;max-width:76ch;
  }

  /* ── responsive ── */
  @media (max-width:1040px){
    .band-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;padding:30px 26px 26px}
    .gaps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .cover{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  }
  @media (max-width:600px){
    .ab-shell{padding:0 16px}
    .band{border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:30px}
    .band-grid{padding:22px 18px 20px}
    .contact{padding:20px}
    .geo{min-width:52px}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .ab *,.ab *::before,.ab *::after{transition-duration:.001ms !important}
  }
</style>
